-----------------------------------------------------------------------------



               Setup commands used in the BBS:SYSTEM/PROTOCOLS
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

AUTOZMODEM(n)                   : DEFAULT: OFF
                                : Auto detection with zmodem batch uploads.

HYDRA(n)                        : DEFAULT: OFF
                                : Enable autostart in hydra sessions.

NAME(n)                  (pt)   : NO DEFAULT
                                : Name of protocol to be shown when user
                                  is prompted to select a transfer protocol.

OPTIONS(n)               (pt)   : DEFAULT: NONE
                                : Init string to used together with the
                                  XPR library protocol

PROTOCOL(n)              (pt)   : NO DEFAULT
                                : Name of XPR protocol to be used.
                                  If you want this protocol number to be
                                  the internal hydra protocol, then
                                  write "HYDRA" as protocol, and ignore
                                  OPTIONS.

